    "short_description": "Acclaimed game designer Roberta Williams revives Colossal Cave as a retro, point-&amp;-click, cave exploration puzzler. Based on the original 1970\u2019s design by Will Crowther &amp; Don Woods this 3D update maintains its vintage charm, while revitalizing it for modern gamers.",
