    "linux_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 @2.9 GHz or AMD equivalent / Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> For Oculus headsets it\u2019s recommended to remain in the Oculus OpenXR runtime. Also note, Colossal Cave currently does not support some pre-2019 controllers (especially older Vive controllers [and a few older Windows headsets] with limited buttons).<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>",
